    "phc.op.pharmacy-dispense": {
      "capability": "pharmacy.dispense",
      "description": "The pharmacist hands over medicine and records it. What gets recorded is what\nthe patient was actually given, which is not always what the doctor wrote.\nStockouts at a primary health centre are routine, so a partial dispense is a\nnormal outcome and not an error.",
